// Windows resource script for chudware-hostd.exe. Embeds the application icon the
// daemon's notification-area (tray) icon loads by resource id (tray_icon.cpp), so the
// tray shows the brand mark in every layout (build tree, staged dist, install) with no
// asset lookup. Wired into the build by core/CMakeLists.txt (WIN32-only). ICON paths
// are relative to this .rc file (core/hostd/).

1 ICON "../../assets/app.ico"
